      "id": 1,
      "text": "Sebastopol got its name after a bar fight in the 1850s that was compared to the siege of Sevastopol during the Crimean War.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
