      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Main Street once ran a Petaluma & Santa Rosa Railroad line that linked Sebastopol to the national network in 1890, before the tracks were removed in the late 1980s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        6,
        7,
        14,
